      "cooked": "<p>Hey quick bug I wanted to reported. Don't have email at moment due to being at hospital and no access to email so can't submit in normal channels. If I can have someone else report that would be great.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Villian: la captain</p><p>heroes: parse, setback, sentinels, adept, expatriate&nbsp;</p><p>environment: tomb of Anubis&nbsp;</p><p>platform: iPhone SE</p><p>la captain has several guys out, doesn't seem to matter for this issue based off my own testing</p><p>heroes again don't have anything of importance in front of them for this bug based off my testing.&nbsp;</p><p>Only environment card is akuni with 3 health (this seems important)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>sentinels turn i play team communication then blackout. I have wraith do the damage and first target akuni and knock it to 1. Then black out does 2 damage to all non villian targets. I first target akuni and destroy it and then &nbsp;blackout does not do damage to anyone else. If I do the 2 damage to anything else then it works up until the damage is done to akuni and then it stops.&nbsp;</p><p>the trigger to blackout stopping doing damage to everything seems to be destroying akuni. I destroyed another villian card before akuni and it worked until I destroyed akuni. I also had wraith target a villian card for the first damage and then did the board damage to reduce akuni to 1 and all damage went thru properly.&nbsp;</p>",
